    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are delighted to bring to the market this spacious and well-presented four-bedroom semi-detached home, ideally situated in Admiran Park and less than a 10-minute walk from Stranorlar's Main Street. This attractive property offers generous living accommodation in a convenient and established residential setting.\nNo. 29 is presented in first-class condition and comprises a Sitting room, large Kitchen/Dining room, Utility Room, WC and integral Garage at ground floor level. Upstairs, there are four well-proportioned Bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, together with a family bathroom.\nRecent improvements include new carpets and laminate flooring throughout the hall, sitting room, dining room, stairs, landing and all bedrooms. The sitting room features an open fire with back boiler, while the integral garage offers great potential for conversion to additional living space or perhaps a 'work from home' space.\nTo the rear, the property enjoys a private garden which backs onto a green area, is not overlooked and benefits from countryside views. \nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious, move-in-ready home in a popular residential development, within easy reach of Stranorlar/Ballybofey amenities and services.\nEarly viewing is highly recommended. Enquiries are welcome and viewing is strictly by appointment — don't delay, as we expect this property won't be available for long."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall, Sitting Room, Kitchen/Dining room, Utility, WC, 4 Bedrooms (master with ensuite), family bathroom and integral garage.<br><br>\nHallway - 4.4m x 1.9m <br>Laminate floor, \n5 stem light fitting,\nCarpeted stairs with white spindles & handrail,\nRadiator.<br><br><br>\nSitting Room - 3.8m x 3.7m <br>Laminate floor continuing from Hallway,\nLarge window to front with venetian blinds,\nOpen fire with back boiler and fire front door,\n5 stem ceiling light fitting,\nDouble Radiator.<br><br><br>\nKitchen-Dining Room - 7.0m x 3.4m <br>Tiled floor in kitchen area,\nGrey coloured high & low units with tiles between,\nGas hob & Electric oven, integrated fridge freezer and free standing dishwasher.\nStainless steel sink at window overlooking rear garden,\nDining area has laminate timber floor,\nPatio doors opening onto stone paved patio area.\nContains oil burner, \nDouble radiator\n<br><br><br>\nUtility - 2.3m x 1.8m <br>Tiled floor,\nBack door,\nPlumbed for washing machine,\nFuse board,\nRadiator.<br><br><br>\nWC - 1.8m x1.0m <br>Tiled floor,\nWhite WHB & WC,\nWindow & Radiator.<br><br><br>\nLanding - 1.9m x 5.9m <br>Carpeted,\nFront facing window with venetian blinds, \n3 stem light fitting,\nContains Airing Cupboard,\nWindow with venetian blinds,\nRadiator.<br><br><br>\nMaster Bedroom - 3.7m x 3.2m <br>Carpeted,\nFront facing window with venetian blinds,\nBuilt-in 3 door wardrobe, \nT.V. point,\nRadiator.<br><br><br>\nEnsuite - 1.6m x 1.7m <br>Tiled floor,\nWhite WHB & WC,\nTriton T90xr electric shower,\nRadiator.<br><br><br>\nBedroom 2 - 3.9m x 3.0m <br>Laminated timber floor,\nFront facing window with venetian blinds,\nRadiator.<br><br><br>\nBedroom 3 - 3.9m x 3.0m <br>Laminated timber floor,\nRear facing window with venetian blinds,\nRadiator.<br><br><br>\nBedroom 4 - 3.7m x 2.8m <br>Carpeted,\nRear facing window with venetian blinds,\nBuilt-in 2 door wardrobe, \nRadiator.<br><br><br>\nBathroom - 2.1m x 1.8m <br>Tiled floor, \nWhite WHB 